  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed front dormers, by reason of their numbers and location at the front elevation, would appear unduly prominent, stack and be out of character with the existing building and surrounding streetscene. The development would therefore be contrary to Policy D4 of the London Plan 2021 and Policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and SPD 4 'Design of Residential Extensions'.",
    "The proposed window in the south flank elevation would result in an adverse impact on the occupiers of 73 York Road in terms of actual and perceived overlooking. The proposed development would be contrary to Policy 29 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and guidance set out in SPD4 'Design of Residential Extensions'."
